%%  X-Lite Sequence Diagram
%%  Interaction flow: User → Frontend → Backend API → Services → ML Model

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Auth as AuthRouter
    participant Upload as UploadRouter
    participant IS as ImageService
    participant Predict as PredictRouter
    participant PS as PredictionService
    participant Model as EfficientNet-B0<br/>+ Performer
    participant GCS as GradCAMService
    participant Report as ReportRouter
    participant RS as ReportService

    Note over User, RS: Authentication Flow
    User->>FE: 1. Open X-Lite App
    FE->>API: 2. GET /api/health
    API-->>FE: 3. System status OK
    User->>FE: 4. Enter credentials
    FE->>Auth: 5. POST /api/auth/login
    Auth-->>FE: 6. JWT Token
    FE->>FE: 7. Store JWT in session

    Note over User, RS: Image Upload Flow
    User->>FE: 8. Upload chest X-ray<br/>drag-drop or click
    FE->>FE: 9. Client-side validation<br/>PNG/JPEG check
    FE->>Upload: 10. POST /api/upload<br/>multipart/form-data + JWT
    Upload->>IS: 11. validate_image(file)
    IS-->>Upload: 12. Validation result
    Upload->>IS: 13. save_image(file)
    IS-->>Upload: 14. Saved file path
    Upload-->>FE: 15. Upload success + image path
    FE->>FE: 16. Show image preview

    Note over User, RS: Diagnosis Flow
    User->>FE: 17. Click "Run Diagnostics"
    FE->>FE: 18. Show loading spinner
    FE->>Predict: 19. POST /api/predict + JWT<br/>image_path
    Predict->>PS: 20. predict(image_path)
    PS->>PS: 21. apply_clahe(image)
    PS->>PS: 22. resize(224x224)
    PS->>PS: 23. normalize(ImageNet stats)
    PS->>Model: 24. forward(preprocessed_tensor)
    Model->>Model: 25. EfficientNet-B0 features
    Model->>Model: 26. Performer attention
    Model->>Model: 27. Classification head
    Model-->>PS: 28. Raw logits (14 classes)
    PS->>PS: 29. sigmoid(logits)
    PS->>PS: 30. Apply per-class thresholds
    PS->>PS: 31. Compute risk levels

    Predict->>GCS: 32. generate_heatmap<br/>top predicted class
    GCS->>Model: 33. Register forward hook<br/>on target layer
    GCS->>Model: 34. Forward pass
    Model-->>GCS: 35. Feature maps + gradients
    GCS->>GCS: 36. Compute weighted activation
    GCS->>GCS: 37. overlay_heatmap(original, heatmap)
    GCS-->>Predict: 38. Heatmap image path

    Predict-->>FE: 39. JSON response<br/>14 predictions + heatmap path
    FE->>FE: 40. Display Results page
    FE->>FE: 41. Render probability bars<br/>with risk indicators
    FE->>FE: 42. Display Grad-CAM overlay

    Note over User, RS: PDF Report Flow
    User->>FE: 43. Click "Download Report"
    FE->>Report: 44. POST /api/report + JWT<br/>prediction data
    Report->>RS: 45. generate_pdf(predictions, images)
    RS->>RS: 46. Create PDF canvas (ReportLab)
    RS->>RS: 47. Add header + timestamp
    RS->>RS: 48. Add X-ray + heatmap images
    RS->>RS: 49. Add findings table
    RS->>RS: 50. Add medical disclaimer
    RS-->>Report: 51. PDF bytes
    Report-->>FE: 52. PDF file response
    FE->>User: 53. Download PDF
